<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="Order service" id="order-service"><mxGraphModel adaptiveColors="auto" pageWidth="3000" pageHeight="2400" dx="1200" dy="800"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
<mxCell id="title" value="Order service :8080" style="text;html=1;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1500" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="sub" value="owns order data. Order is created by a command from the orchestrator, never by the client" style="text;html=1;fontSize=14;align=left;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="52" width="1500" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="l1" value="order.create (steps 2 to 5 are ONE transaction)" style="swimlane;startSize=36;html=1;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="100" width="1380" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="a1" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Validate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;fields, items, total&lt;/small&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="l1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="70" width="230" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="a2" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Record message id&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;duplicate: stop. Tombstone: refuse&lt;/small&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="l1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="70" width="230" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="a3" value="&lt;b&gt;3. Insert order&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;PENDING_PAYMENT, once. An existing order must match&lt;/small&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="l1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="70" width="230" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="a4" value="&lt;b&gt;4. Insert items&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;only if order is new&lt;/small&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="l1"><mxGeometry x="830" y="70" width="230" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="a5" value="&lt;b&gt;5. Reply to outbox&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;Succeeded, then ack&lt;/small&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="l1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="70" width="230" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="a1_a2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="l1" source="a1" target="a2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="a2_a3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="l1" source="a2" target="a3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="a3_a4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="l1" source="a3" target="a4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="a4_a5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="l1" source="a4" target="a5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="bad" value="&lt;b&gt;Invalid command&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;answered Failed, the saga compensates at once&lt;/small&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="350" width="330" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e_bad" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a1" target="bad"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="l2" value="order.mark-paid and order.cancel (later stages, one transaction)" style="swimlane;startSize=36;html=1;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="500" width="1380" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="b1" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Record message id&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;duplicate: stop&lt;/small&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="l2"><mxGeometry x="20" y="70" width="300" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="b2" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Lock the order row&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;unknown order: cancel leaves a tombstone, others answer Failed&lt;/small&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="l2"><mxGeometry x="360" y="70" width="300" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="b3" value="&lt;b&gt;3. Guarded change&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;PENDING_PAYMENT to PAID or CANCELLED&lt;/small&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="l2"><mxGeometry x="700" y="70" width="300" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="b4" value="&lt;b&gt;4. Reply to outbox&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;Succeeded or Failed&lt;/small&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="l2"><mxGeometry x="1040" y="70" width="300" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="b1_b2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="l2" source="b1" target="b2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="b2_b3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="l2" source="b2" target="b3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="b3_b4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="l2" source="b3" target="b4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="schema" value="&lt;font style='font-size:17px'&gt;&lt;b&gt;SCHEMA: orders&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;orders&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK id&lt;br&gt;CHECK status, total above 0&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;order_items&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK id&lt;br&gt;UNIQUE (order_id, product_id)&lt;br&gt;FK order_id to orders&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;outbox&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK id, UNIQUE message_id&lt;br&gt;INDEX (next_attempt_at, created_at) where unpublished&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;processed_messages&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK message_id" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;spacingTop=12;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1480" y="100" width="460" height="600" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="edge" value="&lt;font style='font-size:17px'&gt;&lt;b&gt;STILL OPEN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; &lt;b&gt;EDGE-8&lt;/b&gt; message bookkeeping is purged after 14 days; orders and items are business records and are never purged here&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; &lt;b&gt;IMP-1 (partial)&lt;/b&gt; no hook fails the step the instant the consumer dead-letters it; the saga sweeper covers it within the retry window&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; &lt;b&gt;FEAT-4&lt;/b&gt; a customer cannot cancel a checkout before payment completes" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;spacingTop=12;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="760" width="720" height="440" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="imp" value="&lt;font style='font-size:17px'&gt;&lt;b&gt;DONE IN THE FIX PASS (2026-10-25)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; &lt;b&gt;EDGE-11 (IMP-1)&lt;/b&gt; a command that can never succeed is answered Failed instead of being dead-lettered with no reply&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; &lt;b&gt;EDGE-13 (IMP-2)&lt;/b&gt; cancel for an unknown order records a tombstone and succeeds; a late order.create is refused; mark-paid for a missing order is answered Failed&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; &lt;b&gt;EDGE-12 (IMP-3)&lt;/b&gt; an existing order with different contents is answered Failed; an identical repeat is a normal repeat&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; &lt;b&gt;EDGE-1 / EDGE-2 (IMP-14)&lt;/b&gt; a PAID order is cancelled only by the cancel of a refunded checkout (order.cancel with refunded=true, answered as step CANCEL_PAID_ORDER); an ordinary cancel of a paid order is still refused&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; &lt;b&gt;EDGE-8 (IMP-10)&lt;/b&gt; purge loop for outbox and processed messages&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; &lt;b&gt;IMP-12&lt;/b&gt; the empty leftover tables orders.jobs and orders.checkout_attempts were dropped locally" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;spacingTop=12;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="760" width="720" height="440" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>